WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.140
Soon, we'll be posting out this year's dog
registrations.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:12.380
However before then, we'd like you to check
your details are up to date.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.440
Has your address or contact details changed?

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:22.540
Have you got a new dog, or has a furry friend
passed away?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.520
Has your dog recently been desexed or microchipped?

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.320
If you answered yes to any of these questions,
you'll need to let us know in writing.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:40.100
Pop into any council service centre or visit
waimakariri.govt.nz/dogs to find out more.

